{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/FIFO Backup Rotation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/FIFO Backup Rotation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fifo backup rotation fifo backup rotation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/FIFO Backup Rotation.md","fileName":"FIFO Backup Rotation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"FIFO Backup Rotation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-09 00:00\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Backup and Recovery Strategies]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Backup and Recovery Strategies","cloudcomputing_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/FIFO Backup Rotation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/FIFO Backup Rotation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fifo backup rotation fifo backup rotation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/FIFO Backup Rotation.md","fileName":"FIFO Backup Rotation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"FIFO Backup Rotation","heading":"FIFO Backup Rotation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A first-in, first-out backup rotation reuses or expires the oldest backup slot when a new one is created. A seven-day full-backup cycle, for example, replaces the first day's set on the eighth day and continues in order.\n\nThe same idea can alternate cloud providers rather than physical tapes. Under a differential scheme, one provider can hold a week's full baseline and differentials before the next week's sequence begins with another provider.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Backup and Recovery Strategies","cloudcomputing_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/FIFO Backup Rotation.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/FIFO Backup Rotation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fifo backup rotation fifo backup rotation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes